From a7fc4392d18c5523183613342c0cb8b115611d3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:51:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: source VBUS from the OnePlus
 external boost

Add kernel patches 0096-0099 for the external VBUS supply and
power-role swaps, and enable the external VBUS regulator. Advance to
release 77.

Signed-off-by: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
---
